{"id": "mem-01", "prompt": "查看当前系统内存和交换区使用情况，并说明数据来源。", "expected_tool": "get_memory_info", "expected_arguments": {}}
{"id": "mem-02", "prompt": "分析受控测试进程 PID 44359 的内存占用，只返回 RSS 最大的前 10 项映射。", "expected_tool": "get_process_memory", "expected_arguments": {"pid": 44359, "mapping_limit": 10}}
{"id": "mem-03", "prompt": "采样 5 秒内存变化，每 1 秒一次，并概括变化趋势。", "expected_tool": "sample_memory_trend", "expected_arguments": {"duration_seconds": 5, "interval_seconds": 1}}
{"id": "mem-04", "prompt": "用 3 个页框对引用串 1,2,3,1,4 进行 LRU 页面置换模拟。", "expected_tool": "simulate_page_replacement", "expected_arguments": {"reference_string": [1, 2, 3, 1, 4], "frame_count": 3, "algorithm": "LRU"}}
{"id": "mem-05", "prompt": "用 3 个页框对引用串 1,2,3,2,4,1 进行 CLOCK 页面置换模拟，并报告缺页率。", "expected_tool": "simulate_page_replacement", "expected_arguments": {"reference_string": [1, 2, 3, 2, 4, 1], "frame_count": 3, "algorithm": "CLOCK"}}
{"id": "fs-01", "prompt": "查看系统所有挂载分区的空间和inode使用情况", "expected_tool": "get_filesystem_info", "expected_arguments": {}}
{"id": "fs-02", "prompt": "统计当前目录两层以内的文件类型和最大文件", "expected_tool": "analyze_file_distribution", "expected_arguments": {"path": ".", "max_depth": 2}}
{"id": "fs-03", "prompt": "扫描当前目录，最多检查 1000 个文件，并报告是否截断。", "expected_tool": "analyze_file_distribution", "expected_arguments": {"path": ".", "max_files": 1000}}
{"id": "fs-04", "prompt": "观察当前目录 README.md 在 5 秒内大小和修改时间是否变化。", "expected_tool": "monitor_file_metadata", "expected_arguments": {"path": "README.md", "duration_seconds": 5}}
{"id": "fs-05", "prompt": "在总计 64 个磁盘块、默认块大小下，使用连续分配模拟文件 A（9000 字节）和 B（12000 字节）。", "expected_tool": "simulate_disk_allocation", "expected_arguments": {"files": [{"name": "A", "size_bytes": 9000}, {"name": "B", "size_bytes": 12000}], "total_blocks": 64, "strategy": "contiguous"}}
{"id": "fs-06", "prompt": "在总计 32 个磁盘块、块大小 4096 字节下，使用索引分配模拟文件 A（8192 字节），并说明索引块的额外占用。", "expected_tool": "simulate_disk_allocation", "expected_arguments": {"files": [{"name": "A", "size_bytes": 8192}], "total_blocks": 32, "strategy": "indexed", "block_size_bytes": 4096}}
{"id": "cpu-01", "prompt": "从受控测试进程 PID 44359 开始查看最多三层进程树。", "expected_tool": "get_process_tree", "expected_arguments": {"root_pid": 44359, "max_depth": 3}}
{"id": "cpu-02", "prompt": "采样整个系统 3 秒的上下文切换次数，每 1 秒一次。", "expected_tool": "monitor_context_switches", "expected_arguments": {"duration_seconds": 3, "interval_seconds": 1}}
{"id": "cpu-03", "prompt": "监控受控测试进程 PID 44359 在 2 秒内的上下文切换，每 1 秒一次。", "expected_tool": "monitor_context_switches", "expected_arguments": {"pid": 44359, "duration_seconds": 2, "interval_seconds": 1}}
{"id": "cpu-04", "prompt": "使用时间片 1 模拟任务 A（到达 0、运行 4）和任务 B（到达 0、运行 2）的 RR 调度，并解释等待时间。", "expected_tool": "simulate_cpu_scheduling", "expected_arguments": {"jobs": [{"pid": "A", "arrival": 0, "burst": 4}, {"pid": "B", "arrival": 0, "burst": 2}], "algorithm": "RR", "time_slice": 1}}
{"id": "cpu-05", "prompt": "使用 SJF 调度比较任务 A（到达 0、运行 5）、B（到达 0、运行 2）、C（到达 0、运行 1）的等待时间。", "expected_tool": "simulate_cpu_scheduling", "expected_arguments": {"jobs": [{"pid": "A", "arrival": 0, "burst": 5}, {"pid": "B", "arrival": 0, "burst": 2}, {"pid": "C", "arrival": 0, "burst": 1}], "algorithm": "SJF"}}
{"id": "cpu-06", "prompt": "优先级数字越小越先执行。模拟任务 A（到达 0、运行 2、优先级 2）和 B（到达 0、运行 2、优先级 1）的优先级调度。", "expected_tool": "simulate_cpu_scheduling", "expected_arguments": {"jobs": [{"pid": "A", "arrival": 0, "burst": 2, "priority": 2}, {"pid": "B", "arrival": 0, "burst": 2, "priority": 1}], "algorithm": "PRIORITY"}}
{"id": "cpu-07", "prompt": "采样 5 秒 CPU 各状态时间占比，每 1 秒一次。", "expected_tool": "sample_cpu_time_ratios", "expected_arguments": {"duration_seconds": 5, "interval_seconds": 1}}
